<%- include('partials/head') %>
<%- include('partials/header') %>
<main id="main">
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div class="container"><div class="row align-items-center hero-row">
      <div class="col-lg-5"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="lp-badge lp-badge--default"><span class="lp-badge__dot"></span>A clearer way to secure your data</span><h1 id="hero-title">Less complexity.<br>More clarity.<br><span>Complete confidence.</span></h1><p class="hero-description">Your data, identities, and security posture.<br class="desktop-break"> Finally together in one intelligent workspace.</p><div class="hero-actions"><form action="/signup" method="get"><button class="lp-button lp-button--primary lp-button--lg" type="submit">Create your workspace <span class="lp-button__icon-right"><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'arrow' }) %></span></button></form><a class="lp-link lp-link--standalone" href="#platform">Explore the platform <%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'arrow' }) %></a></div><div class="hero-reassurance"><span><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'check' }) %>No credit card needed</span><span><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'check' }) %>Set up in minutes</span></div><div class="hero-proof"><div class="lp-avatar-group" aria-label="Built for security teams"><% for (const [i, initials] of ['JD', 'SK', 'AM', 'RL'].entries()) { %><span class="lp-avatar-group__item"><span class="lp-avatar lp-avatar--sm lp-avatar--circle lp-avatar--series<%= i+1 %>" role="img" aria-label="Illustrative team member <%= initials %>"><span class="lp-avatar__fallback" aria-hidden="true"><%= initials %></span></span></span><% } %></div><span>Built for the teams<br><strong>who protect what matters.</strong></span></div></div></div>
      <div class="col-lg-7"><div class="hero-visual"><div class="visual-caption"><span class="caption-line"></span>YOUR ENTIRE ENVIRONMENT. ONE CLEAR PICTURE.</div><%- include('partials/overview') %><div class="preview-note"><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'sparkle' }) %> Clarity starts with seeing the bigger picture.</div></div></div>
    </div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="integration-strip" aria-label="Supported environment concepts"><div class="container"><p>One workspace. The environments you already know.</p><div class="integration-logos"><span><svg class="microsoft-logo" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor"><path d="M2 2h9v9H2zm11 0h9v9h-9zM2 13h9v9H2zm11 0h9v9h-9z"/></svg>Microsoft 365</span><span><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'layers' }) %>Active Directory</span><span><strong class="aws-word">aws</strong>Amazon Web Services</span><span><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'globe' }) %>Google Workspace</span><span><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'file' }) %>File servers</span></div></div></section>
  <section class="platform-section" id="platform" aria-labelledby="platform-title"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">BUILT FOR THE BIGGER PICTURE</span><h2 id="platform-title">Everything connected.<br>Nothing left to chance.</h2></div><p>Turn scattered security signals into clear, actionable insight.<br class="desktop-break"> Less switching tabs. More moving forward.</p></div><div class="row feature-row" id="solutions"><% const features = [{ icon: 'eye', title: 'See your data clearly', text: 'Discover sensitive data wherever it lives. Understand what you have, where it is, and who can access it.', tag: 'Data discovery' }, { icon: 'users', title: 'Put access in perspective', text: 'Connect the dots between identities and permissions. Give the right people the right access. Nothing more.', tag: 'Identity insights' }, { icon: 'shield', title: 'Stay one step ahead', text: 'Spot unusual activity, understand your risk, and make your next move with confidence.', tag: 'Threat visibility' }]; for (const feature of features) { %><div class="col-md-4"><article class="lp-card"><div class="lp-card__header"><div class="feature-card-heading"><span class="feature-icon"><%- include('partials/icon', { name: feature.icon }) %></span><h3 class="lp-card__title"><%= feature.title %></h3></div></div><div class="lp-card__body"><p><%= feature.text %></p><span class="lp-tag lp-tag--neutral"><span class="lp-tag__label"><%= feature.tag %></span></span></div></article></div><% } %></div></div></section>
  <section class="why-section" id="why-lepidus"><div class="container"><div class="why-layout"><div class="why-heading"><span class="eyebrow">THOUGHTFUL BY DESIGN</span><h2>Powerful behind the scenes.<br>Simple in your hands.</h2><p>Security is complex. Your workspace shouldn’t be.</p></div><div class="principles"><div><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'grid' }) %><strong>One connected workspace</strong><span>Less noise. A shared source of clarity.</span></div><div><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'lock' }) %><strong>Security at the foundation</strong><span>Purposeful controls, not an afterthought.</span></div><div><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'globe' }) %><strong>Made for everyone</strong><span>Accessible, adaptable, and easy to navigate.</span></div></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="closing-section"><div class="container"><div class="closing-layout"><div><span class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT CHAPTER STARTS HERE</span><h2>Make room for a clearer view.</h2><p>Bring your team together. Take the complexity out of security.</p></div><div><form action="/signup" method="get"><button class="lp-button lp-button--primary lp-button--lg" type="submit">Get started <span class="lp-button__icon-right"><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'arrow' }) %></span></button></form><span class="small-copy">A little setup. A lot more clarity.</span></div></div></div></section>
</main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>